    "title": "Gabe's Forecast: One more round of wet weather brings heavy snow and possible thunderstorms - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gabe Salazar ,\n14 hours ago SAN DIEGO (KGTV) — One more round of wet weather to go with heavy snow and possible thunderstorms. Last round brings rain — mostly Thursday afternoon and evening. Rain will be heavy at times, leading to localized flooding and ponding on roadways during the morning commute, even after the worst of the rain has passed. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
